    "description": "AR/Evo Grip Adaptor V1.2.1: Laffs\n\nAn adaptor designed for mounting standard AR-15 grips to the CZ Scorpion Evo 3.\n\nReuploaded due to reports of previous corrupted files during slicing.\n\n\nUpdate: Refined original geometry to match current Laffs Dynamics specs of Scorpion Evo 3 grip index sections. Moved designer's logo. Added \nan updated model image for preview. \n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 7+\nInfill: 80%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 20%\n\nPrint the adaptor upside-down.\n\n\n\nHardware Required:\n\n1x M4x30mm Bolt (Grind down to 28mm)\n\n1x M4 Hex Nut\n\n1x Allen Head Screw, 1/4-28 x 1\"\n\n1x Steel Star Washer\n\n\n\nAccreditation: \n\nJustinhates: For test fitting the grip adaptor, and providing images. Origin of design request.  \n\nInsertmeow: Original designer of the CZ Sczorpion MOE Grips, which this design uses the top portion of his grip model.",
